{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"松村沙友理です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生誕祭レポpart2です(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"蘭世ちゃんからの手紙に照れる私\n蘭世ちゃんの大きなお目めは  うるうるで\nわんちゃんみたい(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.matsumura/img/blog/sayuri.matsumura/img/2016/09/28/7056234/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆりんご軍団もらった。\nマユコも いるの。笑\nすごいよねー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.matsumura/img/blog/sayuri.matsumura/img/2016/09/28/7056234/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お花も もらった！\nテーマカラーは赤！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.matsumura/img/blog/sayuri.matsumura/img/2016/09/28/7056234/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつかの後ろ姿\nガチャ子さん衣装にガチャ子ポニー\n気分はガチャ子さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.matsumura/img/blog/sayuri.matsumura/img/2016/09/28/7056234/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まっちゅん\nおたんじょうびおめでとう\n泣ける"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.matsumura/img/blog/sayuri.matsumura/img/2016/09/28/7056234/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうです？生誕祭いいでしょ。（私は何もしていない）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"応援の仕方は人それぞれ。\n自分の思う、できるやり方で。\nどんな気持ちも 全部嬉しいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"24歳かぁ、、、\n目標は？って聞かれる度に考えるけど\n年を重ねると どんどん分からなくなって\n目標のない人生なのかなって思ったけど\nそうじゃないのかも。\nやりたいことが 増えていって\nいま生きてる毎日に一生懸命にならなきゃいけないから。\n目標だけ 頑張るなんて出来ないもんね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さよならりんごー"}],"source":"archive"}